* Resolved (already fixed in clautolisp 2.2.4; closed 2026-11-04)

Same defect as windows-msys-paths-in-autolisp-load (issues/closed/, fixed
in clautolisp 2.2.4: the run frame was collapsed onto the build frame, so
/c/... paths were not mapped in). The transcript above is from 1.8.39.
Rechecked on PF5S26BT over ssh with the installed clautolisp 2.3.78:

: (load "/c/users/ppbn02261/claude-probe/fact.lsp")      => loaded, prints loaded-ok
: (findfile "/c/users/ppbn02261/claude-probe/fact.lsp")  => "/c/Users/ppbn02261/claude-probe/fact.lsp"

Nothing left to do here.
